<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back on market at NZ$6.73/80.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back on market at NZ$6.73/80.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it had bought another 1.13 million shares on market as part of the latest phase of its buyback plan.</p>
<p>The purchases during the day had been at prices ranging between NZ$6.73 and $6.80.</p>
<p>The operation is set to continue until Telecom indicates it has finished this part of the buyback.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
